<title>BELGIUM: Tractebel in Jordan gas pipeline deal.</title>
<headline>Tractebel in Jordan gas pipeline deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian utility firm Tractebel said on Wednesday it and Amoco Corporation had signed a deal with the Kingdom of Jordan to build and operate a natural gas pipeline system in the country.</p>
<p>It said that under the agreement the two firms would be solely responsible for gas purchases, transport, distribution and marketing.</p>
<p>However, it did not disclose the value of the deal or the extent of the pipeline system.</p>
<p>Tractebel said the primary customers for the gas would be the fertiliser industry and power generators.</p>
